reference:
The Executive promises that while they work for the Bank and for one year after they stop working for the Bank, they will not: 
- try to hire any Bank employee or anyone who left the Bank in the last 12 months;
- try to make any Bank employee quit their job;
- try to make anyone stop doing business with the Bank or compete with the Bank;
- say bad things about the Bank or its leaders that are not true;
- let anyone they are in charge of or anyone working for them do these things.
